From: Timo <darknagel@proton.me>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 18:49:29 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] linux-postmarketos-qcom-sm8250: wake the phone by
 Wake-on-WLAN

Kernel 0235-0240: the Wi-Fi firmware now learns which MSI wakes the
host, the host listens to it over system sleep, MHI stays out of M3 and
the chip in D0 with its interconnect votes while it is to wake the
system, WoW is enabled for a system suspend, and only SA Query action
frames wake the host. A magic packet now wakes the phone.
